# Implementation Plan - Dynamic Dynamic Question Batches & Enhanced Evaluation

The goal is to replace the rigid, phase-based question logic with a more flexible, AI-driven approach that generates questions in batches of 3. Each question will include a short label and a model answer to improve evaluation accuracy.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - The system will change from "Phase-based" to "Batch-based" (3 questions per batch).
> - Each AI question will now have a "short label" (3-5 words) displayed on the frontend.
> - Evaluation will now compare the candidate's answer against a specific "model answer" generated for that exact question.

## Proposed Changes

### [Backend]

#### [MODIFY] [state.py](file:///d:/A%20-%20AI%20Project/A20-App-011/backend/app/services/state.py)
- Add `pending_questions: list[dict]` to `InterviewState` to store the current batch.
- Each item: `{"question": str, "label": str, "model_answer": str}`.

